# Jack is funny. Jack is kind. If someone is funny, people like them. If someone is kind, people like them.

predicate funny {theme: e}
predicate kind {theme: e}
predicate liked {theme: e}

entity jack : e

funny(theme: jack)
kind(theme: jack)

always [x:e]: funny(theme: x) -> liked(theme: x)
always [x:e]: kind(theme: x) -> liked(theme: x)

? liked(theme: jack)